# CHAPTER IX / VIDEO 11 — THE RISING WIND

=== REF ===

@Image1 = Duel Area environment and spatial reference.
Preserve the same mountain clearing, large old tree, rock formations, rocky ridge and open mountain side.
Maintain the established terrain and spatial relationships.

@Image2 = Yasuo, ten years later.
Preserve his exact face, age, hairstyle, facial hair, clothing, katana and scabbard.

@Image3 = Riven.
Preserve her exact face, age, hairstyle, scars, clothing, armor and sword.
Her sword is complete and intact, with unchanged shape and size.

=== TECHNICAL ===

16:9 cinematic live-action fantasy.

Fast, grounded and physically believable sword combat.
Realistic footwork, body weight, sword contact and defensive reactions.
Natural wet hair and clothing movement.

Dark blue-hour atmosphere, cold blue-gray natural light and subtle mountain fog.
Moderate rain gradually increasing to heavy rain.
Realistic wet dirt, stone and rain splashes.

Yasuo's wind techniques create restrained teal-blue trails following his physical sword and body movements.
No detached energy projectiles or teleportation.

Natural rain, wind, footsteps, breathing and steel clashes.
No subtitles. No background music.
No visible text. No watermark.

=== PREVIOUS VIDEO ===

@Image2 furiously attacked @Image3 with ordinary sword strikes.

@Image3 blocked his final attack and was forced backward.

Both face each other several steps apart with swords drawn in the same clearing.

@Image2 remains aggressive.
@Image3 stands defensively with her intact sword.

Moderate rain is falling.
Neither has used magical abilities yet.

=== VIDEO SUMMARY ===

@Image2 overwhelms @Image3 with two Steel Tempest thrusts and one Wind Dash.

@Image3 narrowly evades and blocks his attacks while retreating. The rain grows heavier, and both finish facing each other several meters apart.

=== VIDEO ===

Begin with a new low camera angle on @Image2's advancing boots, splashing through wet dirt.

The camera rises as he rapidly approaches @Image3.
He attacks with fast sword strikes.
@Image3 blocks and retreats.

Cut to a clear side view.

@Image2 lowers his stance and performs Steel Tempest: one extremely fast, direct sword thrust.

A narrow teal-blue wind trail follows the blade.
@Image3 narrowly turns aside to avoid the thrust.
The wind briefly disturbs the falling rain.

@Image2 immediately performs Wind Dash.

He rapidly dashes past @Image3 at close range in one continuous physical movement, leaving a short teal-blue wind trail.

He turns back toward her and strikes from the new angle.

@Image3 barely raises her intact sword to block.
Their blades collide.

@Image2 continues pressing forward with a short sequence of fast, controlled sword attacks.

@Image3 blocks and retreats, struggling to match his speed.

Rain becomes heavier.

@Image2 launches a final direct Steel Tempest thrust.

@Image3 blocks with her sword, but the force drives her backward several steps.

She regains her balance and raises her intact sword defensively.

@Image2 stops advancing, keeping his katana drawn and ready.

End with a clear medium-wide view of both characters facing each other approximately 3–4 meters apart in the same clearing.

@Image2 remains ready to attack.
@Image3 remains defensive.

Heavy rain continues.
Both characters are visibly wet.

Riven's rune abilities remain inactive.
No dialogue.

