# CHAPTER VII — VIDEO 04: THE FALL

=== REF ===

@Image1 = Cliff environment with the protruding tree branch. Preserve the exact rock wall, branch position, deep abyss and distant Ionian mountains.

@Image2 = Young Yone, without a mask. Preserve his exact face, hairstyle, clothing and body proportions.

@Image3 = Young Yasuo. Preserve his exact face, hairstyle, clothing, katana and scabbard.

@Image4 = Duel Area environment. Preserve the rocky courtyard, cliff edge and mountain geography.

@Image5 = Top-down cliff environment. Preserve the exact view looking downward from the cliff edge into the deep mist-filled abyss.

All three environment references belong to the same mountain location. Maintain consistent geography, lighting and scale.

=== TECHNICAL ===

16:9 cinematic live-action fantasy.

Realistic gravity, body weight, falling motion and physical interaction.

Late afternoon, overcast sky, muted natural light, gentle mountain wind and atmospheric mist deep below the cliff.

Dry, rough stone surfaces, realistic tree bark and natural vegetation.

Natural wind, breathing, cracking wood and falling debris.

No dialogue, no rain, no magic, no background music, no subtitles, no visible text, no watermark.

=== PREVIOUS VIDEO ===

@Image2 saved @Image3 from falling over the cliff.

@Image3 landed safely on the courtyard.

@Image2 lost his footing and fell over the cliff edge.

@Image3 shouted "Yone!" and rushed toward the edge.

@Image2 released his sword before saving his brother and is falling without a sword in his hand.

=== VIDEO SUMMARY ===

@Image2 falls down the cliff and catches a protruding tree branch.

The branch breaks under his weight. He falls again and disappears into the mist.

Above, @Image3 reaches the cliff edge and looks down, but his brother is gone.

=== VIDEO ===

Shot 1 — Wide side view below the cliff.

@Image2 is falling downward alongside the steep rock wall.

He reaches out and catches the protruding tree branch with both hands.

His body swings briefly beneath it as the branch bends under his weight.

Shot 2 — Medium side view.

@Image2 hangs from the branch above the abyss.

The branch begins cracking at its connection to the rock wall.

It suddenly breaks.

Shot 3 — Wide side view of the abyss.

@Image2 falls downward with the broken branch.

His body becomes smaller as he falls deeper into the vast mist-filled chasm.

He disappears completely into the mist.

Shot 4 — Cut to the courtyard above.

@Image3 reaches the cliff edge and looks down, searching desperately for his brother.

Shot 5 — Top-down POV from @Image3's position.

Use @Image5 to establish the steep downward view into the abyss.

The camera looks almost vertically down the cliff wall into the deep mist.

Only rock formations and layers of mist are visible.

@Image2 is no longer visible.

End on the empty abyss.

